# "Look at the top three cards of your library." With only a Lightning Bolt and a Grizzly Bears left, Bot1 looks at those two,
# plots the Grizzly Bears and puts the Bolt into hand, leaving the library empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Make Your Own Luck
Forest
Lightning Bolt
Grizzly Bears

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x27

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Make Your Own Luck.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)
? Exile.Count = 1
? Bot1.Hand = Forest; Lightning Bolt
? Bot1.Library.Count = 0
